      "Protein / serving": "About 24 g",
      "Protein type": "Whey isolate + concentrate",
      "Third-party tested": "Informed Choice (confirm flavor)",
      "Best for": "Building muscle, most men"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "dymatize-iso100-hydrolyzed",
    "name": "Dymatize ISO100 Hydrolyzed Whey Isolate",
    "brand": "Dymatize",
    "badge": "Best for Cutting",
    "category": "Hydrolyzed whey isolate",
    "description": "About 25 g of protein for roughly 110-120 calories per scoop, per the label, so a 40-50 g double dose stays well under 250 calories. That protein-per-calorie ratio is what you want when you are dieting down and trying to keep muscle. It is very low in lactose, and Dymatize states that it carries Informed Choice certification.",
    "pros": [
      "About 25 g protein for roughly 110-120 calories",
      "Very low lactose and fat",
