  {
    "id": "thorne-whey-protein-isolate",
    "name": "Thorne Whey Protein Isolate",
    "brand": "Thorne",
    "badge": "Best for Tested Athletes",
    "category": "Whey isolate",
    "description": "About 21 g of whey isolate per scoop, per the label, with NSF Certified for Sport status, the screening most professional and collegiate sports bodies recognize. If you compete in a drug-tested sport, or simply want the most independent oversight available, this is the pick. You pay a premium for it and the scoop is a little smaller than most isolates.",
    "pros": [
      "NSF Certified for Sport (confirm in the NSF database)",
      "Short ingredient list built around whey isolate",
      "Low lactose and low fat"
