            These picks come from label analysis, published research and certification status, not from a lab of our own or an in-house taste panel. Where we mention taste or mixability, we are describing what buyers widely report. We started with long-established, widely sold products whose labels we could read in full and scored them on the criteria that actually change outcomes for men buying protein. Our <a href="/how-we-test/">methodology page</a> explains the general approach.
